{"4742920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arcade & Motel Simulator Together", "steam_appid": 4742920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras/71003269fd4d6a07287db52f736bfb74.poster.avif?t=1786137404\" width=464 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras/71003269fd4d6a07287db52f736bfb74.webm?t=1786137404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras/71003269fd4d6a07287db52f736bfb74.mp4?t=1786137404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras/0e382531975df908f79942c58bbd1c6b.avif?t=1786137404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras_big/0e382531975df908f79942c58bbd1c6b.webp?t=1786137404 width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Step back into the neon-drenched, synth-heavy universe of the 80s and 90s. Grab your friends and embark on a nostalgic journey to build the ultimate roadside attraction. In this co-op management game, you are tasked with transforming a rundown plot into a thriving retro motel and a legendary arcade complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras/f513031a22beac070bb708b880c15dfd.poster.avif?t=1786137404\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras/f513031a22beac070bb708b880c15dfd.webm?t=1786137404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras/f513031a22beac070bb708b880c15dfd.mp4?t=1786137404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras/8b1b997c28d689498d005f9f22e33f2d.avif?t=1786137404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras_big/8b1b997c28d689498d005f9f22e33f2d.webp?t=1786137404 width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Keep the 90s travelers happy! Handle the daily operations of your roadside motel. Manage the bookings, clean the rooms, and provide excellent service to the weary drivers passing by. Reinvest your profits to upgrade the furniture, expand your room capacity, and offer a comfortable stay that will keep the guests coming back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras/1dbd5d5bb0755e2c2580e75289372da3.poster.avif?t=1786137404\" aria-label=\"gifbuild\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras/1dbd5d5bb0755e2c2580e75289372da3.webm?t=1786137404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras/1dbd5d5bb0755e2c2580e75289372da3.mp4?t=1786137404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras/43517b57d9382f3e3adab494d618c94f.avif?t=1786137404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras_big/43517b57d9382f3e3adab494d618c94f.webp?t=1786137404 width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Managing a busy motel and arcade is a beautifully chaotic experience that requires a coordinated crew. It is all about hustling around the facilities to divide the endless daily chores. While one player is tied up at the front desk checking in guests, the rest of the team is needed next door to fix broken arcade cabinets or clean rooms. Success completely depends on sharing the workload and moving fast to keep the retro business running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras/869514cdf058995cefd03a60bee98aef.poster.avif?t=1786137404\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras/869514cdf058995cefd03a60bee98aef.webm?t=1786137404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras/71003269fd4d6a07287db52f736bfb74.poster.avif?t=1786137404\" width=464 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras/71003269fd4d6a07287db52f736bfb74.webm?t=1786137404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras/71003269fd4d6a07287db52f736bfb74.mp4?t=1786137404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4742920/extras/0e382531975df908f79942c58bbd1c6b